  "bookId": "rewind-30",
  "id": "chapter-115",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "30000001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡车驾驶员",
          "text": "哼哼♪哼......哼哼哼~♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000002",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "车贤秀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "车,贤,秀！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "密闭的黑暗空间内传来熟悉的汽车引擎声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000007",
          "sourceType": 7,
          "text": "车贤秀 · 无畏者\n商品名称：车贤秀·无畏者 Ver.\n作品出处：《甜蜜家园》\n制造商：GALATEA 伽拉\n手办材质：ABS&PVC 涂装完成\n手办规格：1/7比例模型·附专用底座・全高约249mm",
          "title": "角色介绍卡",
          "type": "profile"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "唔，发生了什么事，这是什么地方……\n我的天，那是什么东西？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "暮间猫",
          "text": "真没礼貌，我可不是什么「东西」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "我这是……被关在了箱子里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "可恶！手脚都被固定住了，完全动弹不得……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "明明……刚才还在坐着军用车正在前往目的地……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "大家……都跑去了哪里……?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "这一切究竟是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "说起来，那个长得像猫咪的「东西」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "该不会是新型「怪物」吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "暮间猫",
          "text": "又是「东西」，又是「怪物」，你到底把我当成什么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "可如果说是「怪物」的话，模样看起来又好像有点可爱…",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可疑的手办",
          "text": "锁定那辆卡车，我们按计划行事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "数名形迹可疑的手办突然从卡车正前方齐齐跳下！——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡车驾驶员",
          "text": "不好，有什么东西撞过来了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000022",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "卡车驾驶员",
          "text": "——呃啊啊！！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "剧烈的摇晃中，车上的箱子被甩在了马路边上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "呃！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "突然间是怎么了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "还没弄清自己身处何地，就遭遇意外事故了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000027",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "原来如此……正是因为刚才的冲击，我才能从密闭的空间里逃出来。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "外面的世界居然是这个样子……一切都这么巨大……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "真是难以置信，我不是在做梦吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "眼前这个怎么看都是普通的卡车，可是……卡车原来有这么大吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000031",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这时，燃烧的卡车上张贴的广告映入车贤秀的眼帘——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "一张广告",
          "text": "「SweetHome」经典角色「车贤秀」，1/7手办热卖进行中！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "手办？！我……成了手办……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000034",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "暮间猫",
          "text": "救命！谁来救救我！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "谁在呼救，声音似乎是从滚落的箱子底下传来的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "暮间猫",
          "text": "请帮帮我，我不想莫名其妙地在这里死掉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "车贤秀",
          "text": "又是你，那个长得像怪物的奇怪猫咪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "暮间猫",
          "text": "待会我会详细地向你做自我介绍……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "30000039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "暮间猫",
          "text": "在那之前，可不可以把我从这个箱子里拿出来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-622",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
